Hi Christian,

This would be the correct format:

"ID", "relyonguider_part4", "night_part4"
subject_1, 4, 4
subject_1, 5, 5

"relyonguider_part4" would make that for the specified night, the guider for sleep analysis would be trusted (see section on guiders in the vignette <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIR.html#Sleep_analysis:~:text=argument:%20actilife_LFE.-,5.6.2%20Guiders,-SIBs%20(explained%20above>). Otherwise, "night_part4" would make that the specified night is not included in the part 4 reports.

Best,
Jairo

