Hi Jessie,

I found out the source of your problem, the ID in your activity log is not correct. It states "1.cwa" but your GGIR function call has "idloc = 6", so, if you look at the part2_summary, you will find that the ID for your file is "1", not "1.cwa". GGIR cannot match "1" with "1.cwa".

The solution for you is to remove the ".cwa" from the IDs in your activity log.

Best,
Jairo

